'''Performant Thunderclap''' is the only stage in '''Peril in the Volcano II''', which appears after clearing [[Lava Caves Area 10]]. It drops no rewards, but unlocks stages 11–16 of [[Jinfore Volcano]] when cleared. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

