==Trivia==
*Performant Thunderclap's Japanese name, Kanaderu wa Jinrai no Oto (奏でるは迅雷の音, "Playing is the Sound of Thunderclaps"), is similar to the title of one of the quests in ''[[wikia:monsterhunter:Monster Hunter Portable 3rd|Monster Hunter Portable 3rd]]'': Mau wa Arashi, Kanaderu wa Saika no Shirabe (舞うは嵐、奏でるは災禍の調べ, "Dancing is the Storm, Playing is the Melody of Disaster").

